<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="de">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Neuer Einsatz</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #f4f4f4; }
    .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; background-color: #ffffff; }
    .header { background-color: #1a365d; padding: 30px; text-align: center; }
    .header h1 { color: #ffffff; margin: 0; font-size: 24px; }
    .content { padding: 30px; color: #333333; line-height: 1.6; }
    .details { background-color: #f0f4f8; border-left: 4px solid #2b6cb0; padding: 16px; margin: 16px 0; }
    .details table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; }
    .details td { padding: 6px 0; vertical-align: top; }
    .details td:first-child { font-weight: bold; width: 140px; color: #555; }
    .priority-URGENT { color: #e53e3e; font-weight: bold; }
    .priority-HIGH { color: #d69e2e; font-weight: bold; }
    .priority-NORMAL { color: #38a169; }
    .footer { padding: 20px 30px; text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #888888; border-top: 1px solid #eeeeee; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header"><h1><%= appName %></h1></div>
    <div class="content">
      <h2>Neuer Einsatz zugewiesen</h2>
      <p>Hallo <%= technicianName %>,</p>
      <p>Ihnen wurde ein neuer Einsatz zugewiesen:</p>
      <div class="details">
        <table>
          <tr><td>Einsatz-Nr.:</td><td><%= assignmentNumber %></td></tr>
          <tr><td>Art:</td><td><%= assignmentType %></td></tr>
          <% if (title) { %><tr><td>Titel:</td><td><%= title %></td></tr><% } %>
          <tr><td>Datum:</td><td><%= startDatetime %> - <%= endDatetime %></td></tr>
          <tr><td>Prioritaet:</td><td><span class="priority-<%= priority %>"><%= priority %></span></td></tr>
          <% if (customerName) { %><tr><td>Kunde:</td><td><%= customerName %></td></tr><% } %>
          <% if (siteAddress) { %><tr><td>Adresse:</td><td><%= siteAddress %></td></tr><% } %>
          <% if (instructions) { %><tr><td>Anweisungen:</td><td><%= instructions %></td></tr><% } %>
        </table>
      </div>
      <p>Bitte pruefen Sie die Details in der App.</p>
      <p>Freundliche Gruesse<br><%= appName %></p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer"><p>&copy; <%= year %> <%= appName %> | <a href="mailto:<%= supportEmail %>"><%= supportEmail %></a></p></div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
